00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Dynamic pressure q = ½ρv² is a useful scale for aerodynamic pressure effects under the stated flow model.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
At ρ=1.2 kg/m³ and v=20 m/s, q=240 Pa. This is a scale, not the pressure on every body panel.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Graph reading

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
